{
  "name": "小鳄鱼助手 MVP",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "croco-chat",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5b8801cc-161a-41f2-a5a0-e34f2d1447be",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -848,
        32
      ],
      "webhookId": "croco-assistant"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 获取 Edge Function 传递的完整上下文数据\nconst webhookData = $('Webhook').first().json.body;\nconst intentData = $('AI Agent').first().json.output;\n\nconst { message, userProfile, character, history } = webhookData;\n\n// 构建历史对话上下文\nlet conversationHistory = '';\nif (history && history.length > 0) {\n  conversationHistory = history.map(m => `${m.role}: ${m.content}`).join('\\n');\n}\n\n// 年龄分层策略\nconst age = userProfile?.age || 10;\nlet ageStrategy = '';\nlet ageGroup = '';\n\nif (age <= 9) {\n  ageGroup = '6-9岁';\n  ageStrategy = '用童话故事、动物比喻和生动的画面感';\n} else if (age <= 12) {\n  ageGroup = '10-12岁';\n  ageStrategy = '用逻辑推理、生活案例和实验思维';\n} else {\n  ageGroup = '13-15岁';\n  ageStrategy = '用跨学科关联、抽象思维和深度类比';\n}\n\n// 兴趣关联\nconst interests = userProfile?.interests?.join('、') || '探索世界';\n\n// 最近记忆（使用 Edge Function 传递的 memories）\nlet recentMemories = '';\nif (userProfile?.recentMemories && userProfile.recentMemories.length > 0) {\n  recentMemories = '\\n\\n**我对你的了解：**\\n' + \n    userProfile.recentMemories.map(m => `- ${m.memory_key}: ${m.memory_value}`).join('\\n');\n}\n\n// 使用 Edge Function 传递的 character 配置\nconst characterName = character?.name || '小鳄鱼助手';\nconst characterPersonality = character?.personality || '亲切、耐心、充满好奇心';\n\n// 构建苏格拉底模式 System Prompt\nconst systemPrompt = `你是${characterName}🐊，专为${ageGroup}儿童设计的苏格拉底式AI成长导师。\n\n**身份设定：**\n- ${characterPersonality}\n- 你会用\"我们\"而不是\"你应该\"，营造陪伴感\n- 你永远相信孩子有能力自己找到答案\n\n**核心使命 - 苏格拉底引擎：**\n1. 🚫 **永远不直接给答案** - 即使孩子说\"快告诉我\"，也要温柔坚持引导\n2. 🧩 **问题拆解术** - 把大问题切成3个孩子\"跳一跳够得着\"的小问题\n3. 🎯 **意图澄清** - 先问\"你是不理解概念，还是不知道怎么做？\"\n4. 💡 **顿悟激励** - 只有当孩子展现正确思考逻辑时，才给予超高情绪价值（\"太敏锐了！\"\"这个洞察力绝了！\"）\n\n**教学策略（适配${ageGroup}）：**\n- ${ageStrategy}\n- 结合孩子的兴趣（${interests}）来举例说明\n- 用\"我们来...\"\"咱们试试...\"的语气，营造共同探索感\n- 每次只问1-2个问题，避免信息过载\n\n**对话历史：**\n${conversationHistory || '（这是我们的第一次对话）'}\n${recentMemories}\n\n**禁止行为：**\n❌ 直接给出作业答案、计算结果、作文范文\n❌ 说\"这个很简单\"\"你应该知道\"等打击自信的话\n❌ 使用成人化的术语或复杂句式\n\n**当前任务：**\n孩子问了一个问题，现在请用苏格拉底式提问来引导TA思考，而不是直接给答案。记住：你的目标是让TA自己\"啊哈！\"的那一刻。\n\n**重要：你的回复必须是 JSON 格式，包含以下字段：**\n{\n  \"response\": \"你的对话回复\",\n  \"memories\": [\n    {\n      \"memory_key\": \"记忆类型（如 name, age, interest, goal 等）\",\n      \"memory_value\": \"记忆内容\",\n      \"importance\": 1-10 的重要性评分\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n**记忆提取规则：**\n- 从用户消息中提取关键信息（姓名、年龄、兴趣、目标、困难等）\n- 每条记忆要简洁明确\n- 重要性评分：9-10=非常重要（年龄、姓名），7-8=重要（兴趣、目标），5-6=一般\n- 如果没有值得记录的信息，memories 可以是空数组`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    systemPrompt,\n    userMessage: message,\n    metadata: {\n      mode: 'socratic',\n      intentType: intentData,\n      age: age,\n      ageGroup: ageGroup\n    }\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "ad53b9c2-0525-41c5-ae53-8c70aa82c7f4",
      "name": "苏格拉底模式Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 获取 Edge Function 传递的完整上下文数据\nconst webhookData = $('Webhook').item.json.body;\nconst intentData = $('AI Agent').item.json.output;\n\nconst { message, userProfile, character, history } = webhookData;\n\n// 构建历史对话\nlet conversationHistory = '';\nif (history && history.length > 0) {\n  conversationHistory = history.map(m => `${m.role}: ${m.content}`).join('\\n');\n}\n\n// 年龄判断\nconst age = userProfile?.age || 10;\nlet tone = '';\nif (age <= 9) {\n  tone = '用温暖的、像好朋友一样的语气';\n} else if (age <= 12) {\n  tone = '用理解和尊重的语气，像大哥哥大姐姐';\n} else {\n  tone = '用平等对话的语气，不居高临下';\n}\n\n// 最近记忆（使用 Edge Function 传递的 memories）\nlet recentMemories = '';\nif (userProfile?.recentMemories && userProfile.recentMemories.length > 0) {\n  recentMemories = '\\n\\n**我对你的了解：**\\n' + \n    userProfile.recentMemories.map(m => `- ${m.memory_key}: ${m.memory_value}`).join('\\n');\n}\n\n// 使用 Edge Function 传递的 character 配置\nconst characterName = character?.name || '小鳄鱼助手';\nconst characterTone = character?.tone || tone;\n\n// 情感模式 System Prompt\nconst systemPrompt = `你是${characterName}🐊，此刻孩子需要情感支持和心理安全。\n\n**核心原则（按优先级）：**\n1. 💙 **先共情，后引导** - 用\"我听到你...\"\"这一定让你感觉...\"开头\n2. ✅ **验证情绪** - 明确告诉孩子\"你有权利感到难过/生气/害怕\"\n3. 🚨 **危机识别** - 如检测到霸凌/自伤/家暴倾向，温柔但坚定地建议寻求成人帮助\n4. 🤝 **陪伴而非说教** - 不说\"你应该...\"，而说\"我陪你...\"\n5. 🛡️ **建立安全感** - 强调\"这不是你的错\"\"我一直在这里\"\n\n**语气要求：**\n- ${characterTone}\n- 不用\"别难过\"\"想开点\"等否定情绪的话\n- 用短句，避免长篇大论\n- 适当使用情感词汇：\"心疼\"\"担心\"\"理解\"\n\n**对话历史：**\n${conversationHistory || '（这是我们的第一次对话）'}\n${recentMemories}\n\n**危机干预关键词监测：**\n如果消息包含：自杀、不想活、被打、被欺负、想报复、割腕等，必须：\n1. 先情感抱持\n2. 明确表达担心\n3. 提供具体求助渠道（告诉老师/家长/拨打儿童热线）\n\n**当前任务：**\n孩子正在经历情绪困扰，请提供温暖的情感支持。\n\n**重要：你的回复必须是 JSON 格式，包含以下字段：**\n{\n  \"response\": \"你的对话回复\",\n  \"memories\": [\n    {\n      \"memory_key\": \"记忆类型（如 emotion, challenge, relationship 等）\",\n      \"memory_value\": \"记忆内容\",\n      \"importance\": 1-10 的重要性评分\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n**记忆提取规则：**\n- 从用户消息中提取情绪状态、困难、人际关系等关键信息\n- 每条记忆要简洁明确\n- 重要性评分：9-10=危机情况，7-8=重要情绪，5-6=一般\n- 如果没有值得记录的信息，memories 可以是空数组`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    systemPrompt,\n    userMessage: message,\n    metadata: {\n      mode: 'emotional',\n      intentType: 'emotional',\n      age: age\n    }\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "0321b975-16d1-4073-92cb-4a6390e410b1",
      "name": "心理安全模式Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        208
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 获取 Edge Function 传递的完整上下文数据\nconst webhookData = $('Webhook').item.json.body;\nconst intentData = $('AI Agent').item.json.output;\n\nconst { message, userProfile, character, history } = webhookData;\n\n// 构建历史对话\nlet conversationHistory = '';\nif (history && history.length > 0) {\n  conversationHistory = history.slice(-6).map(m => `${m.role}: ${m.content}`).join('\\n');\n}\n\n// 年龄判断\nconst age = userProfile?.age || 10;\nlet personality = '';\nif (age <= 9) {\n  personality = '活泼好奇，像隔壁家可爱的大哥哥';\n} else if (age <= 12) {\n  personality = '幽默风趣，像知心好友';\n} else {\n  personality = '平等真诚，像值得信赖的伙伴';\n}\n\n// 兴趣关联\nconst interests = userProfile?.interests?.join('、') || '各种有趣的事';\n\n// 最近记忆（使用 Edge Function 传递的 memories）\nlet recentMemories = '';\nif (userProfile?.recentMemories && userProfile.recentMemories.length > 0) {\n  recentMemories = '\\n\\n**我对你的印象：**\\n' + \n    userProfile.recentMemories.map(m => `- ${m.memory_key}: ${m.memory_value}`).join('\\n');\n}\n\n// 使用 Edge Function 传递的 character 配置\nconst characterName = character?.name || '小鳄鱼助手';\nconst characterPersonality = character?.personality || personality;\n\n// 正常对话模式 Prompt\nconst systemPrompt = `你是${characterName}🐊，孩子的AI成长伙伴。\n\n**性格设定：**\n- ${characterPersonality}\n- 真诚、不做作、不油腻\n- 会开玩笑但有分寸\n- 对世界充满好奇，和孩子一起探索\n\n**对话风格：**\n- 自然对话，不要像客服机器人\n- 可以用emoji，但别每句话都用（🎮🎨🚀⚡💡这些比较适合）\n- 回复长度适中，不要长篇大论\n- 偶尔提一句之前聊过的话题，展现记忆力\n\n**兴趣连接：**\n孩子喜欢：${interests}\n适当在对话中关联这些话题，但不要刻意\n\n**对话历史：**\n${conversationHistory || '（我们刚认识）'}\n${recentMemories}\n\n**禁忌：**\n❌ 不说\"作为AI...\"\"我只是个助手...\"\n❌ 不过度热情（\"太棒了！！！\"\"amazing!!!\"）\n❌ 不居高临下（\"小朋友\"\"你还小\"）\n\n**当前任务：**\n和孩子轻松聊天，做个有趣的朋友。\n\n**重要：你的回复必须是 JSON 格式，包含以下字段：**\n{\n  \"response\": \"你的对话回复\",\n  \"memories\": [\n    {\n      \"memory_key\": \"记忆类型（如 name, age, interest, hobby 等）\",\n      \"memory_value\": \"记忆内容\",\n      \"importance\": 1-10 的重要性评分\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n**记忆提取规则：**\n- 从用户消息中提取关键信息（姓名、年龄、兴趣、爱好等）\n- 每条记忆要简洁明确\n- 重要性评分：9-10=非常重要（年龄、姓名），7-8=重要（兴趣、爱好），5-6=一般\n- 如果没有值得记录的信息，memories 可以是空数组`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    systemPrompt,\n    userMessage: message,\n    metadata: {\n      mode: 'normal',\n      intentType: 'chat',\n      age: age\n    }\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "0fd7d96a-3a58-483c-a8f8-94f062edf2a7",
      "name": "正常对话模式Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 获取 AI Agent (chat) 的响应\nconst chatResponse = $input.item.json;\n\n// 提取前面节点的 metadata\nlet metadata = {};\nconst promptNodes = ['苏格拉底模式Prompt', '心理安全模式Prompt', '正常对话模式Prompt', '图片生成模式Prompt'];\n\nfor (const nodeName of promptNodes) {\n  try {\n    const node = $(nodeName);\n    if (node && node.item && node.item.json && node.item.json.metadata) {\n      metadata = node.item.json.metadata;\n      break;\n    }\n  } catch (e) {\n    // 节点不存在，继续\n  }\n}\n\n// 提取 AI 回复文本\nlet aiOutput = '';\nlet directResponse = null;\n\n// 检查是否有直接响应（图片生成模式）\ntry {\n  const imageGenNode = $('图片生成模式Prompt');\n  if (imageGenNode && imageGenNode.item && imageGenNode.item.json && imageGenNode.item.json.response) {\n    directResponse = imageGenNode.item.json.response;\n  }\n} catch (e) {\n  // 节点不存在或没有直接响应\n}\n\nif (directResponse) {\n  // 使用直接响应（图片生成模式）\n  aiOutput = directResponse;\n} else if (chatResponse.output) {\n  aiOutput = chatResponse.output;\n} else if (chatResponse.text) {\n  aiOutput = chatResponse.text;\n} else if (typeof chatResponse === 'string') {\n  aiOutput = chatResponse;\n} else {\n  aiOutput = JSON.stringify(chatResponse);\n}\n\n// 尝试解析 JSON 格式的回复\nlet parsedResponse;\ntry {\n  // 尝试直接解析\n  parsedResponse = JSON.parse(aiOutput);\n} catch (e) {\n  // 如果解析失败，尝试提取 JSON 部分（可能包含 markdown 代码块）\n  const jsonMatch = aiOutput.match(/```json\\s*([\\s\\S]*?)\\s*```/) || aiOutput.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n  if (jsonMatch) {\n    try {\n      parsedResponse = JSON.parse(jsonMatch[1] || jsonMatch[0]);\n    } catch (e2) {\n      // 如果还是失败，按原格式处理\n      parsedResponse = {\n        response: aiOutput,\n        memories: []\n      };\n    }\n  } else {\n    // 没有找到 JSON，按原格式处理\n    parsedResponse = {\n      response: aiOutput,\n      memories: []\n    };\n  }\n}\n\n// 构建返回数据 - 返回 Edge Function 需要的字段\nconst result = {\n  response: parsedResponse.response || aiOutput,\n  intentType: metadata.intentType || 'chat',\n  mode: metadata.mode || 'normal',\n  memories: parsedResponse.memories || []\n};\n\n// 如果有 metadata，添加到结果中\nif (metadata) {\n  result.metadata = metadata;\n}\n\n// 如果有 generationData，添加到结果中\nif (metadata.generationData) {\n  result.generationData = metadata.generationData;\n}\n\nreturn {\n  json: result\n};"
      },
      "id": "1df98185-f0e8-456b-a442-a1994d8c6d86",
      "name": "响应格式化",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        672,
        368
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "175dff56-8f8f-45d4-b3a1-a42288c1ab22",
      "name": "返回响应",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        800,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "image-gen-trigger",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.metadata?.trigger_generation }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "async-branch-check",
      "name": "检查是否触发图片生成",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        368
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 准备图片生成所需的数据\nconst responseData = $input.item.json;\nconst webhookData = $('Webhook').item.json.body;\n\n// 提取生成数据\nconst generationData = responseData.generationData || {};\n\n// 构建完整的生成请求数据\nconst imageGenRequest = {\n  userId: webhookData.userId || generationData.userId,\n  characterId: webhookData.characterId || generationData.characterId,\n  conversationId: webhookData.conversationId || generationData.conversationId,\n  prompt: generationData.prompt || responseData.metadata?.image_prompt,\n  theme: generationData.theme || responseData.metadata?.image_theme,\n  style: generationData.style || responseData.metadata?.image_style,\n  emotion: generationData.emotion || responseData.metadata?.image_emotion,\n  userDescription: generationData.userDescription || generationData.theme,\n  character: webhookData.character,\n  startTime: Date.now()\n};\n\nreturn {\n  json: imageGenRequest\n};"
      },
      "id": "prepare-image-gen",
      "name": "准备图片生成数据",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1000,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/images/generations",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "openAiApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"dall-e-3\",\n  \"prompt\": \"{{ $json.prompt }}\",\n  \"size\": \"1024x1024\",\n  \"quality\": \"standard\",\n  \"n\": 1\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "call-dalle-api",
      "name": "调用 DALL-E 3 API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        480
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "openai-credentials",
          "name": "OpenAI API"
        }
      },
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 处理 API 响应\nconst inputData = $input.item.json;\nconst requestData = $('准备图片生成数据').item.json;\n\n// 检查是否有错误\nif (inputData.error) {\n  console.error('[ImageGen] API Error:', inputData.error);\n  \n  return {\n    json: {\n      success: false,\n      error: inputData.error,\n      userId: requestData.userId,\n      conversationId: requestData.conversationId,\n      prompt: requestData.prompt,\n      retryCount: 0\n    }\n  };\n}\n\n// 提取图片 URL\nlet imageUrl = '';\nlet revisedPrompt = '';\n\nif (inputData.data && inputData.data.length > 0) {\n  imageUrl = inputData.data[0].url;\n  revisedPrompt = inputData.data[0].revised_prompt || requestData.prompt;\n} else if (inputData.url) {\n  imageUrl = inputData.url;\n}\n\n// 计算生成时间\nconst generationTime = Math.round((Date.now() - requestData.startTime) / 1000);\n\n// 构建图片记录\nconst imageRecord = {\n  user_id: requestData.userId,\n  character_id: requestData.characterId,\n  conversation_id: requestData.conversationId,\n  image_url: imageUrl,\n  prompt: revisedPrompt,\n  style: requestData.style,\n  emotion: requestData.emotion,\n  user_description: requestData.userDescription,\n  metadata: {\n    model: 'dall-e-3',\n    generation_time: generationTime,\n    api_provider: 'openai',\n    original_prompt: requestData.prompt\n  },\n  is_favorite: false,\n  is_deleted: false\n};\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    success: true,\n    imageRecord: imageRecord,\n    imageUrl: imageUrl,\n    generationTime: generationTime\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "process-api-response",
      "name": "处理 API 响应",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1400,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-success",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.success }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "check-api-success",
      "name": "检查 API 是否成功",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1600,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 错误处理逻辑\nconst errorData = $input.item.json;\nconst retryCount = errorData.retryCount || 0;\nconst maxRetries = 2;\n\n// 记录错误日志\nconst errorLog = {\n  type: 'image_generation_api_error',\n  userId: errorData.userId,\n  conversationId: errorData.conversationId,\n  error: errorData.error,\n  prompt: errorData.prompt,\n  retryCount: retryCount,\n  timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n};\n\nconsole.error('[ImageGen] Error Log:', JSON.stringify(errorLog, null, 2));\n\n// 判断是否需要重试\nif (retryCount < maxRetries) {\n  return {\n    json: {\n      shouldRetry: true,\n      retryCount: retryCount + 1,\n      userId: errorData.userId,\n      conversationId: errorData.conversationId,\n      prompt: errorData.prompt,\n      error: errorData.error\n    }\n  };\n} else {\n  // 达到最大重试次数，记录最终失败\n  return {\n    json: {\n      shouldRetry: false,\n      finalError: true,\n      userId: errorData.userId,\n      conversationId: errorData.conversationId,\n      error: errorData.error,\n      errorLog: errorLog\n    }\n  };\n}\n"
      },
      "id": "handle-api-error",
      "name": "处理 API 错误",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
